    "fullDescription": "<p style=\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\"><font face=\"georgia, serif\"><strong>Role:</strong> Cyber Security Engineer</font></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\"><font face=\"georgia, serif\"><strong>Location:</strong> Springfield, VA – Onsite</font></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\"><font face=\"georgia, serif\"><strong>Clearance:</strong> Active TS/SCI; ability to obtain a Polygraph</font></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\"><font face=\"georgia, serif\"><strong>Experience:</strong> Bachelor's degree and/or 6+ years of cybersecurity experience</font></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\"><font face=\"georgia, serif\"><strong>Certifications:</strong> DoD 8140.01 / DoD 8570.01-M IAT Level II and CSSP Incident Responder</font></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:small\"><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span style=\"orphans:2\"><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"widows:2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong><font face=\"georgia, serif\">Key Responsibilities:</font></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"color:#222222; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:small; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; orphans:2; text-align:start; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; widows:2; word-spacing:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\">\r\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><font face=\"georgia, serif\">Support cyber incident response, investigation, containment, eradication, and recovery activities.</font></li>\r\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><font face=\"georgia, serif\">Perform digital media analysis, malware analysis, reverse engineering, and system artifact analysis.</font></li>\r\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><font face=\"georgia, serif\">Develop indicators of compromise (IOCs), signatures, timelines, incident reports, and briefings.</font></li>\r\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><font face=\"georgia, serif\">Support C-IRT operations and Defensive Cyberspace Operations.</font></li>\r\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><font face=\"georgia, serif\">Develop and execute authorized scripts and tools for incident investigation and response.</font></li>\r\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><font face=\"georgia, serif\">Coordinate with CSOC Tier 1/2 teams and other relevant stakeholders.</font></li>\r\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><font face=\"georgia, serif\">Document incident activity, analysis, and recommendations through authorized reporting systems.</font></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:small\"><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span style=\"orphans:2\"><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"widows:2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><font face=\"georgia, serif\">A <strong>Master's degree and IAT III certification</strong> would be a plus.</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n",
