    "summary": "<p><strong>Job Title:</strong> Senior ServiceNow Developer</p>",
    "fullDescription": "<p><strong>Job Title:</strong> Senior ServiceNow Developer</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Location:</strong> Fort Meade, MD | Scott Air Force Base, IL | Ogden, UT</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Employment Type:</strong> Full-Time</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Work Arrangement:</strong> Onsite</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Security Clearance:</strong> Active Secret Clearance Required</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Job Summary</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We are seeking an experienced <strong>Senior ServiceNow Developer</strong> to support mission-critical Department of Defense (DoD) programs. The ideal candidate will have extensive experience designing, developing, and maintaining enterprise ServiceNow solutions while collaborating with cross-functional teams in a secure Agile environment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Responsibilities</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\n\t<li>Design, develop, configure, and maintain ServiceNow applications and platform capabilities.</li>\r\n\t<li>Develop solutions across ITSM, Service Catalog, CMDB, Flow Designer, Workflows, Dashboards, and Reporting.</li>\r\n\t<li>Build and maintain integrations with third-party applications using REST, SOAP, and other integration technologies.</li>\r\n\t<li>Perform platform upgrades, enhancements, and customizations following ServiceNow best practices.</li>\r\n\t<li>Support enterprise modules including ITSM, OMT, TSM, TSOM, and Workforce Management.</li>\r\n\t<li>Collaborate with stakeholders, business analysts, and technical teams to deliver scalable solutions.</li>\r\n\t<li>Participate in Agile ceremonies including sprint planning, daily stand-ups, and retrospectives.</li>\r\n\t<li>Mentor junior developers and contribute to code reviews and platform governance.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Required Qualifications</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\n\t<li>4+ years of hands-on ServiceNow development experience.</li>\r\n\t<li>Strong experience with ITSM, Service Catalog, Flow Designer, scripting (JavaScript), and platform integrations.</li>\r\n\t<li>Experience with ServiceNow platform customization and upgrades.</li>\r\n\t<li>Strong understanding of Agile/Scrum development methodologies.</li>\r\n\t<li>Active Secret or Top Secret Clearance.</li>\r\n\t<li>Security+ CE certification (DoD 8570 IAT Level II).</li>\r\n\t<li>Ability to work onsite at one of the following locations:\r\n\t<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\n\t\t<li>Fort Meade, MD</li>\r\n\t\t<li>Scott Air Force Base, IL</li>\r\n\t\t<li>Ogden, UT</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Preferred Qualifications</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\n\t<li>ServiceNow Certified Application Developer (CAD).</li>\r\n\t<li>ITIL Certification.</li>\r\n\t<li>Experience with OMT, TSM, TSOM, AWS, Jira, Git, Confluence, and CI/CD pipelines.</li>\r\n\t<li>Experience supporting DoD or other federal government environments.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
