    "summary": "<div><strong>Job Title: </strong>Customer Service Representative (CSR)<br />",
    "fullDescription": "<div><strong>Job Title: </strong>Customer Service Representative (CSR)<br />\r\n<strong>Place of Performance: </strong>Jacksonville Aviation Authority (JAA), Jacksonville, Florida.<br />\r\n<strong>Employment Type:</strong> Staffing Services Contract Support<br />\r\n<strong>Experience Required: </strong>Minimum 3 years of relevant recruiting and staffing services experience (per RFP).<br />\r\n </div>\r\n\r\n<div><strong>Job Summary</strong><br />\r\nServe as the primary point of contact between the staffing contractor and Jacksonville Aviation Authority (JAA). Coordinate recruitment, onboarding, placement, issue resolution, and day-to-day contract administration while ensuring timely delivery of qualified temporary personnel.<br />\r\n </div>\r\n\r\n<div><strong>Key Responsibilities</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Serve as the designated CSR for the JAA contract.</li>\r\n\t<li>Coordinate requisitions and recruit qualified candidates across Administrative, IT,</li>\r\n\t<li>Finance, and Skilled Craft positions.</li>\r\n\t<li>Screen candidates, verify qualifications, conduct reference/background checks, and coordinate onboarding.</li>\r\n\t<li>Maintain regular communication with JAA hiring managers regarding staffing status.</li>\r\n\t<li>Monitor employee attendance, performance, timesheets, and issue resolution.</li>\r\n\t<li>Ensure compliance with contract requirements, employment laws, and company policies.</li>\r\n\t<li>Prepare staffing reports and maintain recruitment documentation.</li>\r\n\t<li>Coordinate replacement personnel when required.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\n<strong>Required Qualifications</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Bachelor's degree in Human Resources, Business Administration, or related field (preferred).</li>\r\n\t<li>Minimum 3 years of recruiting and staffing experience.</li>\r\n\t<li>Experience supporting temporary staffing or workforce management contracts.</li>\r\n\t<li>Strong communication, customer service, and organizational skills.</li>\r\n\t<li>Proficiency with ATS, Microsoft Office, and HR information systems.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div><strong>Preferred Certifications</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>SHRM-CP/SHRM-SCP (preferred)</li>\r\n\t<li>PHR/SPHR (preferred)</li>\r\n\t<li>Staffing Industry certification (optional)<br />\r\n\t </li>\r\n</ul>",
    "updatedDate": "3 months ago",
    "applyUrl": "https://candidateportal.ceipal.com/job-details/HPGAwoGEm-EYAxIWxTKu_8SkrXFbBCGp6nWeJkNabQ0"
