    "summary": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-c2e9bab4-7fff-7b27-e43c-d7e611eb7746\">Job Title: </b>System Administrator<br />",
    "fullDescription": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-c2e9bab4-7fff-7b27-e43c-d7e611eb7746\">Job Title: </b>System Administrator<br />\r\n<strong>Location:</strong> Gaithersburg, MD<br />\r\n<strong>Clearance Required:</strong> Active Top Secret (TS) with ability to obtain TS/SCI with Polygraph</p>\r\n\r\n<h4 dir=\"ltr\"><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-c2e9bab4-7fff-7b27-e43c-d7e611eb7746\">Primary Responsibilities</b></h4>\r\n\r\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<li>Lead system administration for Linux and Windows-based systems in secure, mission-critical environments</li>\r\n\t<li>Architect and manage server, storage, and virtualization infrastructure (VMware, KVM)</li>\r\n\t<li>Perform OS installation, configuration, hardening, and patching in compliance with DoD STIGs and agency policies</li>\r\n\t<li>Monitor and optimize system performance; conduct root cause analysis and resolve complex issues</li>\r\n\t<li>Design and support backup, disaster recovery (DR), and continuity of operations (COOP) strategies</li>\r\n\t<li>Develop and maintain automation scripts and Infrastructure as Code (IaC) (Ansible, PowerShell, Bash)</li>\r\n\t<li>Maintain system documentation, configuration baselines, and support CM/RM processes</li>\r\n\t<li>Lead deployment of system enhancements and modernization initiatives (Chinook program)</li>\r\n\t<li>Collaborate with cybersecurity, networking, and software teams to ensure compliance and performance</li>\r\n\t<li>Participate in security audits, incident response, and operational readiness</li>\r\n\t<li>Provide Tier 2/3 support, including troubleshooting escalated issues and minimizing downtime</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h4 dir=\"ltr\"><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-c2e9bab4-7fff-7b27-e43c-d7e611eb7746\">Basic Qualifications</b></h4>\r\n\r\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<li>U.S. Citizenship (required per contract)</li>\r\n\t<li>Education & Experience:\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li>Bachelor's + 8–12 years of relevant experience OR</li>\r\n\t\t<li>Master's + 6–10 years of relevant experience</li>\r\n\t\t<li>Additional experience may substitute for a degree</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li role=\"presentation\">Active Top Secret clearance with ability to obtain TS/SCI with Polygraph</li>\r\n\t<li role=\"presentation\">DoD 8570 IAT Level II or III certification (e.g., Security+ CE, CASP+, CISSP)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h4 dir=\"ltr\"><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-c2e9bab4-7fff-7b27-e43c-d7e611eb7746\">Technical Skills</b></h4>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<div>Cloud platforms: AWS GovCloud, Azure Government, hybrid environments</div>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<div>OS administration: Linux (RHEL/CentOS) and Windows Server</div>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>Virtualization: VMware, KVM</li>\r\n\t<li>Scripting/Automation: Ansible, Bash, PowerShell, Python</li>\r\n\t<li>Security & Compliance:\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li>STIGs, system hardening</li>\r\n\t\t<li>ACAS scans</li>\r\n\t\t<li>RMF processes</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>Strong understanding of:\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li>Enterprise networking</li>\r\n\t\t<li>Identity & access management (IAM)</li>\r\n\t\t<li>Storage systems</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-c2e9bab4-7fff-7b27-e43c-d7e611eb7746\">Core Competencies</b></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Advanced troubleshooting and documentation</li>\r\n\t<li>Ability to lead projects independently</li>\r\n\t<li>Experience supporting DoD or IC classified environments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h4 dir=\"ltr\"><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-c2e9bab4-7fff-7b27-e43c-d7e611eb7746\">Preferred Qualifications</b></h4>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<h4>Experience supporting GEOINT or similar mission areas</h4>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>Familiarity with DevOps tools and pipelines (Git, Jenkins, Docker)</li>\r\n\t<li>Knowledge of:\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li>Enterprise backup solutions</li>\r\n\t\t<li>DNS, DHCP</li>\r\n\t\t<li>Active Directory</li>\r\n\t\t<li>Public Key Infrastructure (PKI)</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
