    "fullDescription": "<p data-end=\"124\" data-section-id=\"105dmz4\" data-start=\"105\"><strong data-end=\"139\" data-start=\"126\">Job Title:</strong> Software Engineer</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"303\" data-start=\"126\"><strong data-end=\"139\" data-start=\"126\">Location:</strong> Annapolis Junction, Maryland</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"729\" data-start=\"691\"><strong data-end=\"705\" data-start=\"691\">Clearance:</strong> TS/SCI with Polygraph</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"771\" data-start=\"732\"><strong data-end=\"748\" data-start=\"732\">Work Authorization:</strong> US Citizen<br />\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<h3 data-end=\"797\" data-section-id=\"sf49ng\" data-start=\"778\">Position Overview</h3>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"957\" data-start=\"798\">The <strong data-end=\"823\" data-start=\"802\">Software Engineer</strong> will develop, maintain, and troubleshoot <strong data-end=\"894\" data-start=\"865\">GHOSTGEM's software suite</strong>, including <strong data-end=\"914\" data-start=\"906\">DINO</strong> and future mission-related capabilities.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1150\" data-start=\"959\">The role involves <strong data-end=\"1029\" data-start=\"977\">design, implementation, testing, and integration</strong> of software components with <strong data-end=\"1116\" data-start=\"1058\">COTS, GOTS, and FOSS products, libraries, and packages</strong> within a Linux-based environment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1179\" data-section-id=\"ls18e3\" data-start=\"1157\">Key Responsibilities</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1755\" data-start=\"1180\">\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1263\" data-section-id=\"pzoto8\" data-start=\"1180\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1263\" data-start=\"1182\">Develop and maintain software applications within the <strong data-end=\"1263\" data-start=\"1236\">GHOSTGEM software suite</strong></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1355\" data-section-id=\"11ukeg4\" data-start=\"1264\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1355\" data-start=\"1266\">Implement new features and maintain existing capabilities for <strong data-end=\"1355\" data-start=\"1328\">DINO and future systems</strong></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1416\" data-section-id=\"1cqqk15\" data-start=\"1356\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1416\" data-start=\"1358\">Troubleshoot and resolve issues across software components</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1495\" data-section-id=\"13hoj3d\" data-start=\"1417\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1495\" data-start=\"1419\">Integrate internally developed software with <strong data-end=\"1495\" data-start=\"1464\">COTS/GOTS/FOSS technologies</strong></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1568\" data-section-id=\"1kngvpk\" data-start=\"1496\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1568\" data-start=\"1498\">Develop and maintain <strong data-end=\"1568\" data-start=\"1519\">automation scripts and containerized services</strong></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1629\" data-section-id=\"f4930c\" data-start=\"1569\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1629\" data-start=\"1571\">Support deployment pipelines and infrastructure automation</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1701\" data-section-id=\"11wv0il\" data-start=\"1630\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1701\" data-start=\"1632\">Participate in testing, validation, and system integration activities</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1755\" data-section-id=\"11k5agz\" data-start=\"1702\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1755\" data-start=\"1704\">Collaborate with cross-functional engineering teams</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1779\" data-section-id=\"19pegy5\" data-start=\"1762\">Required Skills</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"2558\" data-start=\"1780\">\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1840\" data-section-id=\"3yan6b\" data-start=\"1780\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1840\" data-start=\"1782\">Strong experience using <strong data-end=\"1840\" data-start=\"1806\">Linux CLI and associated tools</strong></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1878\" data-section-id=\"lmdpgn\" data-start=\"1841\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1878\" data-start=\"1843\">Scripting experience using <strong data-end=\"1878\" data-start=\"1870\">Bash</strong></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1927\" data-section-id=\"1pqhi6\" data-start=\"1879\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1927\" data-start=\"1881\">Recent <strong data-end=\"1904\" data-start=\"1888\">Python (3.x)</strong> development experience</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"2001\" data-section-id=\"103yvwe\" data-start=\"1928\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"2001\" data-start=\"1930\">Knowledge of <strong data-end=\"1972\" data-start=\"1943\">Rust programming concepts</strong> or willingness to learn Rust</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"2065\" data-section-id=\"19bndpd\" data-start=\"2002\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"2065\" data-start=\"2004\">Experience with <strong data-end=\"2039\" data-start=\"2020\">NoSQL databases</strong>, particularly <strong data-end=\"2065\" data-start=\"2054\">MongoDB</strong></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"2155\" data-section-id=\"80yntq\" data-start=\"2066\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"2155\" data-start=\"2068\">Experience with <strong data-end=\"2117\" data-start=\"2084\">containerization technologies</strong> such as <strong data-end=\"2136\" data-start=\"2126\">Docker</strong> and <strong data-end=\"2155\" data-start=\"2141\">containerd</strong></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"2234\" data-section-id=\"70qj89\" data-start=\"2156\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"2234\" data-start=\"2158\">Experience with <strong data-end=\"2211\" data-start=\"2174\">container orchestration platforms</strong> such as <strong data-end=\"2234\" data-start=\"2220\">Kubernetes</strong></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"2299\" data-section-id=\"kwspef\" data-start=\"2235\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"2299\" data-start=\"2237\">Experience creating <strong data-end=\"2272\" data-start=\"2257\">Helm Charts</strong> for Kubernetes deployments</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"2364\" data-section-id=\"5lyn1z\" data-start=\"2300\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"2364\" data-start=\"2302\">Familiarity with <strong data-end=\"2343\" data-start=\"2319\">messaging frameworks</strong> such as <strong data-end=\"2364\" data-start=\"2352\">RabbitMQ</strong></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"2439\" data-section-id=\"l75ll1\" data-start=\"2365\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"2439\" data-start=\"2367\">Understanding of <strong data-end=\"2417\" data-start=\"2384\">CI/CD practices and pipelines</strong> (e.g., <strong data-end=\"2438\" data-start=\"2425\">GitLab CI</strong>)</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"2517\" data-section-id=\"14l9cgz\" data-start=\"2440\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"2517\" data-start=\"2442\">Familiarity with <strong data-end=\"2491\" data-start=\"2459\">Infrastructure as Code (IaC)</strong> tools such as <strong data-end=\"2517\" data-start=\"2506\">Ansible</strong></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"2558\" data-section-id=\"hg2hpw\" data-start=\"2518\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"2558\" data-start=\"2520\">Experience with <strong data-end=\"2543\" data-start=\"2536\">Git</strong> source control</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2581\" data-section-id=\"1fdejrg\" data-start=\"2565\">Desired Skills</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"2719\" data-start=\"2582\">\r\n\t<li data-end=\"2644\" data-section-id=\"uyodzr\" data-start=\"2582\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"2644\" data-start=\"2584\">Experience with <strong data-end=\"2617\" data-start=\"2600\">SQL databases</strong>, especially <strong data-end=\"2644\" data-start=\"2630\">PostgreSQL</strong></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"2719\" data-section-id=\"1qkcvx6\" data-start=\"2645\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"2719\" data-start=\"2647\">Familiarity with <strong data-end=\"2683\" data-start=\"2664\">Atlassian tools</strong> such as <strong data-end=\"2700\" data-start=\"2692\">Jira</strong> and <strong data-end=\"2719\" data-start=\"2705\">Confluence</strong></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>",
