    "fullDescription": "<div><strong>Position Name: </strong> Cloud FinOps / Cost Analyst<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Location:</strong> Remote<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Job Overview</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nMonitor, analyze, and optimize cloud costs across multiple cloud platforms</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nDevelop and maintain cost allocation models, budgets, and forecasts</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nIdentify cost-saving opportunities and efficiency improvements</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nImplement and manage FinOps best practices and governance frameworks</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nCreate dashboards and reports to provide cloud spend visibility</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nPartner with engineering teams to promote cost-aware architecture and design</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nTrack usage trends and deliver actionable financial and operational insights</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nSupport chargeback and showback models</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\n<strong>Required Qualifications</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nBachelor's degree in Finance, Information Technology, Business, or a related field</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nExperience in cloud cost management or FinOps practices</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nStrong analytical and financial modeling skills</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nExperience with cloud cost management tools (native or third-party)</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nAbility to translate technical cloud usage into financial insights</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\n<strong>Preferred Qualifications</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nFinOps Foundation certification (Practitioner or Professional)</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nExperience with OCI, AWS, or GCP cost management tools</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nAdvanced proficiency in Excel, SQL, or BI/dashboarding tools</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nExperience in enterprise or regulated environments</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nStrong communication and stakeholder management skills<br />\r\n </div>",
