    "fullDescription": "<div><strong>Position Name:</strong> Oracle Cloud Engineer<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Job Location:</strong> Remote<br />\r\n <br />\r\n<strong>Job Overview</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nDesign, deploy, and manage cloud environments on Oracle Cloud Infrastructure (OCI)</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nImplement Infrastructure as Code (IaC) using tools such as Terraform or OCI Resource Manager</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nManage OCI networking, IAM, security, and monitoring services</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nSupport migration of on-premises or multi-cloud workloads to OCI</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nAutomate provisioning, scaling, and operational tasks</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nTroubleshoot and resolve infrastructure and performance issues</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nCollaborate with DevOps, security, and application teams</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nEnsure compliance with enterprise and regulatory standards</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\n<strong>Required Qualifications</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nBachelor's degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or equivalent practical experience</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nOracle Cloud Infrastructure (OCI) Associate or Professional certification</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nHands-on experience with OCI services (Compute, Networking, Storage, IAM)</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nExperience with Infrastructure as Code (IaC)</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nStrong understanding of cloud security, networking, and monitoring</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nExperience with Linux/Unix environments</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\n<strong>Preferred Qualifications</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience with Terraform and CI/CD pipelines</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nKnowledge of Kubernetes, Docker, and container orchestration</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nExperience supporting government or regulated cloud environments</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nStrong documentation and communication skills<br />\r\n </div>",
