    "summary": "<p dir=\"ltr\">Position Name: Risk Analyst (ICFR / SOX Control Testing)<b> </b><br />",
    "fullDescription": "<p dir=\"ltr\">Position Name: Risk Analyst (ICFR / SOX Control Testing)<b> </b><br />\r\nLocation: Hybrid – Vienna, VA<br />\r\n    • 3 days onsite / 2 days remote<br />\r\nDuration: Long-Term / Ongoing (No End Date)</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Role Overview</h2>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The Risk Analyst will support SOX and ICFR control testing within a large financial institution, focusing on Real Estate Lending (REL). This is a 1st Line of Defense (LOD) role responsible for executing control testing, managing risk issues and findings, and partnering closely with senior leadership, audit, and regulatory stakeholders.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Key Responsibilities</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Execute SOX / ICFR control testing for the largest product portfolio: Real Estate Lending<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Act as a 1st Line of Defense (LOD) risk partner supporting business and senior management<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support the development and implementation of operational risk management frameworks, methodologies, policies, standards, and procedures<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Identify, assess, and mitigate operational, financial, legal, reputational, and compliance risks associated with Real Estate Lending<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Perform and facilitate Risk Control Self-Assessments (RCSAs)<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Identify, track, manage, and report issues, findings, and risk events<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Perform root cause analysis for control deficiencies and findings<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Evaluate corrective action plans and track remediation progress to closure<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Ensure business unit adherence to approved remediation actions<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Collaborate with Real Estate Lending teams and other operational risk functions across the organization<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Liaise regularly with internal audit, external audit, and regulatory examiners<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Review and edit policies and procedures supporting business operations<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Recommend and implement process and system improvements to strengthen risk controls<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Promote operational efficiency and service excellence through effective risk management strategies</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Required Qualifications</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Bachelor's degree in Economics, Business, Engineering, Technology, Statistics, Mathematics, or a related analytical field<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Hands-on controls testing experience (SOX, ICFR, Compliance, or other operational controls) – Required<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Prior experience in Risk Management, Data Analytics, or Internal Audit within a financial institution<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Hands-on experience using GRC systems<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Proven experience performing and facilitating Risk Control Self-Assessments (RCSAs) – Required<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience with:<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Issue and finding identification, tracking, and reporting<br />\r\n\t\t </p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Inherent vs. residual risk assessment<br />\r\n\t\t </p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Key vs. non-key control identification<br />\r\n\t\t </p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Strong understanding of industry best practices in operational risk and controls</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Preferred / Plus Qualifications</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Big 4 or consulting firm experience<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience working with banking or credit union regulators<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Knowledge of Real Estate Lending<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Familiarity with regulatory bodies and requirements, including:<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">NCUA<br />\r\n\t\t </p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">CFPB<br />\r\n\t\t </p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Freddie Mac<br />\r\n\t\t </p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Fannie Mae<br />\r\n\t\t </p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">FHA<br />\r\n\t\t </p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">VA<br />\r\n\t\t </p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Risk Management or Regulatory Compliance certifications such as PRM or FRM</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Additional Skills & Competencies</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Strong stakeholder management and collaboration skills<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Excellent problem-solving and decision-making abilities<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Ability to work independently with sound judgment and high integrity<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Strong verbal, written, and presentation skills; ability to communicate complex concepts clearly to senior leadership<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Advanced skills in data analysis, reporting, and external research, including forecasting and cost-benefit analysis<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Demonstrated leadership ability and capability to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Excellent organizational, planning, and time management skills</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>",
