    "summary": "<div><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><strong>Position Name:</strong> IAM Systems Administrator – CyberArk PAM<br />",
    "fullDescription": "<div><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><strong>Position Name:</strong> IAM Systems Administrator – CyberArk PAM<br />\r\n<strong>Location:</strong> Remote<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Education & Experience Requirements:</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nBachelor's degree in Information Security, Computer Science, Information Systems Management, or related field (Preferred)<br />\r\nMinimum 2 years of hands-on operational experience with CyberArk PAM<br />\r\nCyberArk certification required<br />\r\nGraduation dates must be listed on the resume</span><br />\r\n </div>\r\n\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><strong>Role Overview</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe IAM Systems Administrator – CyberArk Privilege Cloud will manage and optimize the CyberArk Privileged Access Management (PAM) platform, ensuring secure credential management and compliance with Zero Trust principles. This role collaborates with security, cloud, infrastructure, and compliance teams to maintain operational resilience.</span><br />\r\n </div>\r\n\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><strong>Key Responsibilities</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nOperate and maintain CyberArk Privileged Cloud environments<br />\r\nOnboard/manage privileged accounts, safes, and credentials using PVWA, PSM, CPM<br />\r\nTroubleshoot password rotation, policy issues, and integrations<br />\r\nMonitor CyberArk health and performance<br />\r\nConfigure/enforce security policies<br />\r\nSupport audits and maintain documentation</span><br />\r\n </div>\r\n\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><strong>Required Qualifications</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nMinimum 2-year college degree required.<br />\r\nMUST have 2+ years CyberArk PAM operational experience<br />\r\nCyberArk certification<br />\r\nStrong understanding of IAM, PAM, and Zero Trust principles<br />\r\nFamiliarity with PVWA, PSM, CPM<br />\r\nKnowledge of Active Directory, LDAP, RBAC<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Preferred</strong>:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBachelor's degree in information security, Computer Science, Information Systems Management, or related field<br />\r\nExperience with CyberArk EPM, WPM, cloud platforms (AWS, Azure), SailPoint IIQ<br />\r\nScripting skills (PowerShell, Python)<br />\r\nSecurity certifications (CISSP, CISM, CISA)<br />\r\nKnowledge of compliance frameworks (HIPAA, PCI-DSS, SOX)</span><br />\r\n </div>",
