    "summary": "<p dir=\"ltr\">Position Name: Data Scientist</p>",
    "fullDescription": "<h3 dir=\"ltr\"> </h3>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Position Name: Data Scientist</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Location: Remote</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Job Type: Full-Time</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Role Overview</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">We are seeking a highly skilled Data Scientist with deep Generative AI expertise to architect and deliver production-grade AI agents and agentic workflows. This role is ideal for professionals who have transitioned from traditional Machine Learning into GenAI, with hands-on experience building, deploying, and operating LLM-powered systems at scale.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Must-Have Qualifications</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Hands-on experience transitioning from Machine Learning to Generative AI solutions<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Strong proficiency in Python, with extensive use of Jupyter notebooks<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Solid experience with RAG architectures, agent-based workflows, and data-centric AI systems<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Strong understanding of data engineering principles, embeddings, and vector search<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience integrating AI agents into end-to-end software workflows</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Preferred Qualifications</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience building and deploying AI Agents in production environments<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience with MCP (Model Context Protocol) and A2A (Agent-to-Agent) communication patterns<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Hands-on expertise with Graph RAG architectures<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Proven experience deploying GenAI applications to production</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Key Responsibilities</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Architect and implement scalable AI Agents, agentic workflows, and GenAI applications to solve complex enterprise use cases<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Develop, fine-tune, evaluate, and optimize lightweight LLMs, including Claude (Anthropic), Azure OpenAI, and open-source models<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Design and deploy RAG and Graph RAG systems using vector databases and enterprise knowledge bases<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Curate and manage enterprise data using connectors integrated with AWS Bedrock Knowledge Bases and Elastic<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Implement solutions leveraging MCP and A2A communication for distributed agent ecosystems<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Build and maintain Jupyter-based development environments using AWS SageMaker, MLFlow, and Kubeflow on Kubernetes (EKS)<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Collaborate with UI engineers, backend/microservice engineers, designers, and data engineers to deliver full-stack GenAI experiences<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Integrate GenAI capabilities with enterprise platforms through API-driven architectures and standardized GenAI patterns<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Define and enforce evaluation frameworks, bias mitigation strategies, safety protocols, and guardrails for production deployments<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Design and implement robust ingestion pipelines to extract, chunk, enrich, and anonymize data from PDFs, audio, and video, applying best practices such as semantic chunking and privacy controls<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Orchestrate multimodal ETL/ELT pipelines using scalable frameworks such as Apache Spark / PySpark<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Implement embedding pipelines to map unstructured media into vector representations and integrate with vector stores (AWS Knowledge Base, Elastic, Mongo Atlas) to support RAG architectures</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Qualifications</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Bachelor's or Master's degree in Artificial Intelligence, Data Science, Computer Science, or a related field<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">3+ years of experience delivering applied GenAI or LLM-based solutions<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Deep expertise in prompt engineering, fine-tuning, RAG, GraphRAG, vector databases, and multimodal models<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Strong experience with cloud-native AI development, including AWS SageMaker, Amazon Bedrock, and MLFlow on EKS<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Advanced proficiency in Python and GenAI/ML libraries such as Transformers, LangChain, or equivalent frameworks<br />\r\n\t </p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Strong understanding of GenAI system design patterns, architectural best practices, and evaluation methodologies</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Demonstrated ability to work effectively in cross-functional, agile engineering teams</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>",
    "updatedDate": "10 months ago",
    "applyUrl": "https://candidateportal.ceipal.com/job-details/-V3mFW4bWwG1A-WbIqUGirGRjOuFv1fa07Rq5i2hnw0"
