    "summary": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Position Name</strong>: Software Engineer</p>",
    "fullDescription": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Position Name</strong>: Software Engineer</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Location</strong>: Remote<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Job Type</strong>: Full-Time</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>About the Role</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">We are seeking an experienced Full Stack Software Engineer to join a cross-functional engineering team delivering secure, scalable, and high-performance enterprise applications in AWS cloud environments. This role is a blend of full-stack development and DevSecOps, supporting large-scale big data platforms and modern microservices-based architectures.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The ideal candidate has strong hands-on experience across the full Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC), excels in Java-based backend development and modern frontend frameworks, and has a solid foundation in DevSecOps practices within AWS.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Key Responsibilities</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Participate in all phases of the SDLC including design, development, testing, deployment, and sustainment</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Collaborate with designers, analysts, and engineers to deliver secure, scalable solutions</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Design technical solutions and develop high-quality, maintainable, and testable code</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Estimate story size and level of effort to meet user story acceptance criteria</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Develop automated tests, deployment scripts, and database solutions</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Manage and support code in production environments to ensure system stability</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Build and maintain system monitoring, dashboards, and operational metrics</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Provide troubleshooting support for production and network-related issues, distinguishing application-level problems</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Conduct end-to-end testing and system integration</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Perform debugging, defect resolution, and performance tuning</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Participate in design and code reviews to ensure compliance with standards and best practices</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Develop and maintain technical and system documentation</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Share best practices, mentor junior developers, and improve development processes</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Work effectively within Agile delivery teams and across multiple functional groups</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Required Qualifications</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Minimum 5 years of IT experience using DevSecOps practices in AWS cloud environments</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">At least 3 years of hands-on software engineering experience supporting front-end and back-end applications and/or data services</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience designing, deploying, and supporting large-scale, high-performance enterprise big data applications in complex AWS environments</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Strong experience with Java and Spring Boot</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience building modern web applications using Angular and/or React</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Hands-on experience with CI/CD pipelines (Jenkins, Harness, Concourse, Snap, or similar)</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience with Apache Hadoop ecosystem tools (Hadoop, Hive, Sqoop, Spark, Tomcat, Ignite, etc.)</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience with microservices and containerized architectures, including JHipster</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Strong understanding of Git/GitHub and source control practices</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience with test automation tools (Cucumber, Selenium, Cypress)</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience with TDD and BDD methodologies</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience working with complex SQL queries</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Strong communication skills and ability to collaborate across teams</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience delivering solutions using Agile/Scrum methodologies</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Preferred / Additional Skills</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience with technologies such as Kotlin, Scala, Cassandra, Kubernetes, gRPC</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Familiarity with AWS Lambda, TypeScript, Prometheus, and common design patterns</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience with reporting tools such as JasperReports (nice to have)</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Exposure to advanced monitoring, logging, and observability tools</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>",
