    "summary": "<p data-end=\"559\" data-start=\"272\"><strong data-end=\"285\" data-start=\"272\">Position Name: </strong>Network Administrator<br />",
    "fullDescription": "<p data-end=\"559\" data-start=\"272\"><strong data-end=\"285\" data-start=\"272\">Position Name: </strong>Network Administrator<br />\r\n<strong data-end=\"285\" data-start=\"272\">Location:</strong> Vienna, VA (Onsite – Headquarters)<br />\r\n<strong>Job Type</strong>: Full time<br />\r\n<br data-end=\"323\" data-start=\"320\" />\r\n<strong>Position Overview</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"933\" data-start=\"588\">We are seeking a <strong data-end=\"636\" data-start=\"605\">Network Administrator</strong> to support a large-scale <strong data-end=\"710\" data-start=\"662\">End-of-Life Cisco switch replacement project</strong> across <strong data-end=\"750\" data-start=\"718\">200+ global branch locations</strong>. This role is responsible for hands-on Cisco switch configuration, troubleshooting, device decommissioning, and coordinating multi-site network migrations across multiple time zones.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1167\" data-start=\"935\">The ideal candidate has strong Cisco networking expertise, experience managing large-scale branch migrations, and the ability to coordinate internal teams, vendors, and remote hands to ensure on-time and successful project delivery.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1198\" data-start=\"1174\"><strong>Key Responsibilities</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"2225\" data-start=\"1199\">\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1271\" data-start=\"1199\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1271\" data-start=\"1201\">Configure, upgrade, patch, and troubleshoot Cisco routers and switches</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1331\" data-start=\"1272\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1331\" data-start=\"1274\">Support network migrations across global branch locations</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1417\" data-start=\"1332\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1417\" data-start=\"1334\">Perform secure wiping and decommissioning of legacy network devices prior to eWaste</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1479\" data-start=\"1418\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1479\" data-start=\"1420\">Monitor network performance using multiple monitoring tools</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1559\" data-start=\"1480\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1559\" data-start=\"1482\">Respond to alerts and alarms; proactively identify and resolve network issues</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1648\" data-start=\"1560\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1648\" data-start=\"1562\">Create, manage, and resolve incident and change tickets using service management tools</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1712\" data-start=\"1649\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1712\" data-start=\"1651\">Coordinate end-to-end change management for branch migrations</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1822\" data-start=\"1713\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1822\" data-start=\"1715\">Interface with internal teams, vendors, carriers, and contractors to resolve outages and performance issues</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1904\" data-start=\"1823\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1904\" data-start=\"1825\">Coordinate onsite vendors, remote hands, and branch personnel during migrations</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1965\" data-start=\"1905\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1965\" data-start=\"1907\">Maintain and update technical documentation and procedures</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"2021\" data-start=\"1966\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"2021\" data-start=\"1968\">Perform preventative maintenance on network equipment</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"2101\" data-start=\"2022\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"2101\" data-start=\"2024\">Configure and troubleshoot LAN/WAN circuits including turn-ups and turn-downs</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"2158\" data-start=\"2102\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"2158\" data-start=\"2104\">Manage multiple migrations and project tasks per shift</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"2225\" data-start=\"2159\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"2225\" data-start=\"2161\">Perform additional duties as assigned based on operational needs</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2259\" data-start=\"2232\"><strong>Required Qualifications</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"3185\" data-start=\"2260\">\r\n\t<li data-end=\"2321\" data-start=\"2260\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"2321\" data-start=\"2262\">Strong knowledge of Cisco networking (routers and switches)</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"2377\" data-start=\"2322\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"2377\" data-start=\"2324\">Hands-on experience with VLAN creation and management</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"2503\" data-start=\"2378\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"2451\" data-start=\"2380\">Knowledge of LAN/WAN architectures, protocols, and standards including:</p>\r\n\r\n\t<ul data-end=\"2503\" data-start=\"2454\">\r\n\t\t<li data-end=\"2503\" data-start=\"2454\">\r\n\t\t<p data-end=\"2503\" data-start=\"2456\">EIGRP, BGP, Metro Ethernet, TCP/IP, SDLC, RS232</p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"2603\" data-start=\"2504\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"2603\" data-start=\"2506\">Experience troubleshooting network connectivity issues, both locally and via remote support teams</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"2712\" data-start=\"2604\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"2712\" data-start=\"2606\">Prior experience supporting large-scale network equipment migrations across geographically dispersed sites</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"2800\" data-start=\"2713\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"2800\" data-start=\"2715\">Proven ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously in a fast-paced environment</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"2873\" data-start=\"2801\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"2873\" data-start=\"2803\">Experience coordinating internal teams, vendors, and service providers</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"2941\" data-start=\"2874\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"2941\" data-start=\"2876\">Strong documentation, ticketing, and change management experience</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"2993\" data-start=\"2942\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"2993\" data-start=\"2944\">Excellent verbal and written communication skills</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"3045\" data-start=\"2994\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"3045\" data-start=\"2996\">Ability to work independently and collaboratively</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"3123\" data-start=\"3046\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"3123\" data-start=\"3048\">Ability to work under pressure with tight deadlines and changing priorities</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"3185\" data-start=\"3124\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"3185\" data-start=\"3126\">Demonstrated reliability, accuracy, and attention to details</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3 data-end=\"3220\" data-start=\"3192\"><strong>Preferred Qualifications</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"3659\" data-start=\"3221\">\r\n\t<li data-end=\"3310\" data-start=\"3221\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"3310\" data-start=\"3223\">Bachelor's degree in Information Technology or related field (or equivalent experience)</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"3339\" data-start=\"3311\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"3339\" data-start=\"3313\">CCNA or CCNP certification</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"3402\" data-start=\"3340\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"3402\" data-start=\"3342\">Experience presenting technical solutions or recommendations</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"3451\" data-start=\"3403\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"3451\" data-start=\"3405\">Advanced troubleshooting and analytical skills</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"3521\" data-start=\"3452\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"3521\" data-start=\"3454\">Knowledge of electronic principles related to IT system diagnostics</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"3604\" data-start=\"3522\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"3604\" data-start=\"3524\">Understanding of software, hardware, LAN, WAN, and host system interdependencies</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"3659\" data-start=\"3605\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"3659\" data-start=\"3607\">Familiarity with Navy Federal operations (preferred)</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>",
    "updatedDate": "10 months ago",
