    "summary": "<div>Job Title: Journeyman Test Engineer<br />",
    "fullDescription": "<div>Job Title: Journeyman Test Engineer<br />\r\nLocation: Springfield, Virginia<br />\r\nJob Type: On-site<br />\r\nClearance Required: Top Secret with SCI eligible</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nOverview:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe're seeking a skilled Journeyman Engineer who thrives on solving complex problems and improving processes in a collaborative, DevOps-driven environment. You'll contribute to testing and evaluation (T&E) efforts for cloud-based and software-intensive systems—helping ensure reliability, scalability, and performance across AWS, DevOps, and Java/Python environments.</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nResponsibilities</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Analyze system requirements, concepts of operations, and acquisition plans to develop test strategies, procedures, and reports.</li>\r\n\t<li>Plan and execute test events—collecting, analyzing, and interpreting results to ensure system readiness.</li>\r\n\t<li>Support development of T&E documentation, including Test & Evaluation Master Plans, Event Test Plans, Readiness Assessments, and Reports.</li>\r\n\t<li>Collaborate with other test organizations to integrate T&E programs across functional and technical domains.</li>\r\n\t<li>Provide specialized testing capabilities tailored to system maturity, performance, and risk.</li>\r\n\t<li>Maintain transparency on progress, blockers, and results to stakeholders and leadership.</li>\r\n\t<li>Execute automated and manual tests; confirm and validate system results.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div>Qualifications</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Bachelor's degree; or Associate's degree plus 4 years of experience; or minimum 6 years of related experience.</li>\r\n\t<li>Demonstrated ability to follow established processes and perform self-guided work.</li>\r\n\t<li>Seeks guidance only for new or undefined tasks.</li>\r\n\t<li>Strong understanding of AWS cloud services, DevOps practices, and Java/Python development.</li>\r\n\t<li>Experience with CI/CD pipelines, infrastructure-as-code (IaC), and automated testing frameworks.</li>\r\n\t<li>Proactive team contributor; able to lead tasks and mentor junior staff over time.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div>Preferred Skills</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Familiarity with Agile/Scrum environments.</li>\r\n\t<li>Experience integrating testing across multi-cloud or hybrid systems.</li>\r\n\t<li>Solid communication skills with the ability to simplify complex technical findings.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<qb-div data-qb-element=\"re-enable-flow\" style=\"z-index: 2147483647; max-width: 1px; max-height: 1px; box-sizing: border-box; position: fixed; top: 10px; right: 10px;\">\r\n<div style=\"all: initial !important;\"><qb-div style=\"all: initial !important;\"></qb-div></div>\r\n</qb-div>",
