    "summary": "<div><strong>Position Name: </strong>Systems Administrator<br />",
    "fullDescription": "<div><strong>Position Name: </strong>Systems Administrator<br />\r\n<strong>Location: </strong>Chantilly/Sterling, VA<br />\r\n<strong>Citizenship:</strong> US Citizen <br />\r\n<strong>Clearance required:</strong> TS/SCI <br />\r\n<strong>Job Type:</strong> On-site<br />\r\n </div>\r\n\r\n<div>We are seeking a System Administrator (Tier 1/2 Support) with strong Linux expertise and a passion for delivering excellent customer service. In this frontline role, you will be responsible for monitoring systems, assisting end users, and escalating issues as needed.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe ideal candidate is detail-oriented, organized, and comfortable working directly with customers to provide clear, professional, and helpful support.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs a System Administrator, you will:</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Work with <strong>Linux</strong> systems through the command line.</li>\r\n\t<li>Perform scripting tasks.</li>\r\n\t<li>Manage environments running on <strong>AWS</strong> and <strong>Kubernetes</strong>.</li>\r\n\t<li>Monitor system dashboards to ensure the health and performance of mission-critical services.</li>\r\n\t<li>Proactively identify issues and escalate them to Tier 2 support when necessary.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\nThis role also includes managing an equipment inventory, documenting processes, and creating FAQs and guides to assist end users. You must have a solid foundation in IT protocols and system architecture and hold a <strong>Security+ certification</strong>. Strong communication skills are essential, as you will interact with end users to diagnose issues, provide solutions, and escalate when appropriate.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis position is well-suited for a self-starter who thrives in a structured yet dynamic environment, is highly organized, and motivated to contribute to both system stability and end-user success.</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br />\r\n<strong>Key Responsibilities</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Serve as the first line of support for end-user issues, providing articulate and professional assistance.<br />\r\n\t </li>\r\n\t<li>Troubleshoot and resolve Tier 1 issues involving Linux systems, scripting, AWS, and Kubernetes.<br />\r\n\t </li>\r\n\t<li>Monitor dashboards to ensure system health, escalating potential issues to Tier 2 support when required.<br />\r\n\t </li>\r\n\t<li>Maintain accurate records of hardware and software inventory.<br />\r\n\t </li>\r\n\t<li>Document solutions, create end-user FAQs, and contribute to the knowledge base.<br />\r\n\t </li>\r\n\t<li>Ensure security compliance with Security+ principles and IT security best practices.<br />\r\n\t </li>\r\n\t<li>Collaborate with internal teams to improve processes, streamline workflows, and enhance end-user satisfaction.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div><strong>Required Skills & Qualifications</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Proficiency with <strong>Linux</strong> administration, including command line usage and scripting.<br />\r\n\t </li>\r\n\t<li>Hands-on experience with <strong>AWS</strong> services and containerized environments (<strong>Kubernetes</strong>).<br />\r\n\t </li>\r\n\t<li>Strong troubleshooting and problem-solving abilities with a focus on Tier 1 support.<br />\r\n\t </li>\r\n\t<li>Familiarity with IT protocols, system architecture, and IT infrastructure.<br />\r\n\t </li>\r\n\t<li>Excellent communication and interpersonal skills for customer-facing interactions.<br />\r\n\t </li>\r\n\t<li>Ability to monitor system dashboards and identify performance or health issues.<br />\r\n\t </li>\r\n\t<li>Strong organizational skills with attention to detail (inventory and documentation).<br />\r\n\t </li>\r\n\t<li><strong>Security+ certification</strong> (or equivalent) required.<br />\r\n\t </li>\r\n\t<li>Self-starter who can work independently while contributing effectively to a team.</li>\r\n</ul>",
    "updatedDate": "1 year ago",
    "applyUrl": "https://candidateportal.ceipal.com/job-details/OnGfEJsTUOEfB__5EBdbbCLf-G5efY6usEk9k7cjSV8"
