    "fullDescription": "<p>Role: <strong>Senior Network Engineer</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Location: <strong>Colorado Springs, CO</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Experience: <strong>12 years</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Job Type: <strong>Full-Time</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Position Overview</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>We are seeking an experienced <strong>Senior Network Engineer</strong> to join our client's team and play a key role in managing, maintaining, and enhancing our enterprise-scale network infrastructure. This role requires expertise in designing, implementing, and troubleshooting complex network environments to ensure optimal performance, security, and reliability. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in network technologies, security protocols, and leadership capabilities.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Key Responsibilities</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Configure and maintain network devices including routers, switches, firewalls, load balancers, and VPN concentrators and <strong>IBM DataPower Gateways.</strong></li>\r\n\t<li>Monitor network performance, identify bottlenecks, and implement optimization strategies to ensure maximum throughput and reliability.</li>\r\n\t<li>Troubleshoot and resolve network issues using tools such as firewall logs, switch packet capture tools, and Wireshark, while collaborating with cross-functional teams for support.</li>\r\n\t<li>Conduct network capacity planning and bandwidth management to address future growth and evolving business requirements.</li>\r\n\t<li>Collaborate with teams to integrate network infrastructure with cloud services, storage systems, and other IT components.</li>\r\n\t<li>Stay updated on emerging technologies, industry trends, and networking best practices, and recommend their adoption when beneficial.</li>\r\n\t<li>Develop and maintain comprehensive documentation, including network configurations, diagrams, standard operating procedures, and troubleshooting guides.</li>\r\n\t<li>Provide technical leadership, mentorship, and guidance to junior network engineers.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Qualifications</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><strong>Education:</strong> Bachelor's degree in a related field (additional experience may be considered in lieu of a degree).</li>\r\n\t<li><strong>Experience:</strong> At least 12 years of experience in network engineering or related roles.</li>\r\n\t<li><strong>Clearance:</strong> An <strong>active Secret Clearance</strong> is required.</li>\r\n\t<li><strong>Certifications:</strong> Must possess at least one of the following:</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n\t<li>Cisco Certified Network Professional <strong>(CCNP)</strong></li>\r\n\t<li>Cisco Certified Design Expert <strong>(CCDE)</strong></li>\r\n\t<li>Cisco Certified Internetwork Expert <strong>(CCIE)</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Proven expertise in designing, implementing, and managing enterprise-scale networks.</li>\r\n\t<li>Hands-on experience with IBM DataPower Gateway, including deployment, configuration, and troubleshooting.</li>\r\n\t<li>Proficiency in network security technologies, including firewalls, IDS/IPS, VPNs, and secure remote access.</li>\r\n\t<li>Ability to work independently, manage priorities, and handle multiple projects effectively.</li>\r\n\t<li>Flexibility to be available for on-site work as needed.</li>\r\n\t<li>Strong communication skills, team-oriented mindset, and a proactive approach to problem-solving.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Preferred Skills</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Experience in cloud networking and integration with platforms such as AWS, Azure, or Google Cloud.</li>\r\n\t<li>Familiarity with SD-WAN and software-defined networking (SDN) technologies.</li>\r\n\t<li>Advanced knowledge of network automation tools and scripting.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Why Join Us?</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Be part of a mission-critical team supporting operations across geographically diverse locations.</li>\r\n\t<li>Opportunity to work with cutting-edge technologies and advance your career in a dynamic environment.</li>\r\n\t<li>Collaborate with a team of professionals dedicated to excellence and innovation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
